OL,3,GNEWSAExecutive's early promise has
OL,4,A'evaporated' - SDLP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current Stormont Executive's "early
OL,7,Fpromise has evaporated", the leader of
OL,8,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,9,F(SDLP) told their annual conference.
OL,11,FClaire Hanna said Northern Ireland's
OL,12,Ffour-party coalition is offering "more
OL,13,Fchaff than change" with "big decisions
OL,14,Fkicked back into the long grass".
OL,16,FStormont's larger parties have now
OL,17,Fturned to "raking over the past instead
OL,18,Fof a focus on the future", she said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
