OL,3,GNEWSAExecutive's early promise has
OL,4,A'evaporated' - SDLP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe conference in Belfast on Saturday
OL,7,Fwas Hanna's third as leader of the
OL,8,FSDLP, which is the official opposition
OL,9,Fin the legislative assembly.
